{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4peVQHocCzZ2WB9RMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain is old oak — dark, weathered, scarred by centuries of knuckles and weather. Iron studs dot my face in rows. My hinges are black, hand-forged, stiff with age. A keyhole sits at my center like an unblinking eye, and through it: a cold draft carrying the smell of stone and something older than stone.\n\nI do not open easily.\n\nI do not open for everyone.\n\n**What do you bring to the lock?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":141,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}